    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/1fe6fd84aad8bc22c64697e33a593750.avif?t=1732205958\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satellite odyssey</strong> - a series of adventure games about human exploration of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/32a4ee676e15b61a465e0320442ad29f.poster.avif?t=1732205958\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/32a4ee676e15b61a465e0320442ad29f.webm?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/32a4ee676e15b61a465e0320442ad29f.mp4?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, dear explorer, to Europa \u2014 the jewel among Jupiter's moons, a symbol of humanity's unwavering will to reach for the stars. Here, on this frozen wasteland, we built a base that serves as a beacon of our perseverance and scientific brilliance. But as is often the case, a place created for discovery can conceal the unimaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Satellite Odyssey: Jupiter, you will open the doors to a dark and restless world where hope intersects with danger. You will face not only revelations but trials, where every step you take matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/8110af44bc43feb8ae5ba4cd83294247.poster.avif?t=1732205958\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/8110af44bc43feb8ae5ba4cd83294247.webm?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/8110af44bc43feb8ae5ba4cd83294247.mp4?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique dynamic of two heroes: Experience the synergy of skills between a man and his loyal dog. Use their individual abilities to solve puzzles and overcome obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A narrative that delves into the depths of human nature: This base is not just a settlement; it is a battleground for ideas, fears, and ambitions. Explore its secrets and prepare for an encounter with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battles that require intellect and resolve: Use the arsenal of tools found on the base to fend off enemies, or develop alternative strategies to avoid direct combat. Every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Retrofuturism aesthetic: A world where technology and ambitious dreams of the future intertwine, creating a unique atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich atmosphere: We used Steam Audio technology so that every sound in the game feels immersive from all directions. Muted noises, echoes in metal corridors, and the vibrations of machines enhance the experience. Every whisper and rustle not only brings the world to life but also keeps you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/7af9ff1d06e5f448bf00d8aa80b4a609.poster.avif?t=1732205958\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/7af9ff1d06e5f448bf00d8aa80b4a609.webm?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/7af9ff1d06e5f448bf00d8aa80b4a609.mp4?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Silent space: The beautiful and harsh face of the universe simultaneously entices and warns: its mysteries are far from friendly. But it is in this challenge that our true purpose lies, is it not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready, brave explorer, to uncover what really happened on this distant outpost of humanity? Or will you become just another link in its chain of mysteries? Europa awaits your answer.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/1fe6fd84aad8bc22c64697e33a593750.avif?t=1732205958\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satellite odyssey</strong> - a series of adventure games about human exploration of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/32a4ee676e15b61a465e0320442ad29f.poster.avif?t=1732205958\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/32a4ee676e15b61a465e0320442ad29f.webm?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/32a4ee676e15b61a465e0320442ad29f.mp4?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, dear explorer, to Europa \u2014 the jewel among Jupiter's moons, a symbol of humanity's unwavering will to reach for the stars. Here, on this frozen wasteland, we built a base that serves as a beacon of our perseverance and scientific brilliance. But as is often the case, a place created for discovery can conceal the unimaginable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Satellite Odyssey: Jupiter, you will open the doors to a dark and restless world where hope intersects with danger. You will face not only revelations but trials, where every step you take matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/8110af44bc43feb8ae5ba4cd83294247.poster.avif?t=1732205958\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/8110af44bc43feb8ae5ba4cd83294247.webm?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/8110af44bc43feb8ae5ba4cd83294247.mp4?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique dynamic of two heroes: Experience the synergy of skills between a man and his loyal dog. Use their individual abilities to solve puzzles and overcome obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A narrative that delves into the depths of human nature: This base is not just a settlement; it is a battleground for ideas, fears, and ambitions. Explore its secrets and prepare for an encounter with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battles that require intellect and resolve: Use the arsenal of tools found on the base to fend off enemies, or develop alternative strategies to avoid direct combat. Every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Retrofuturism aesthetic: A world where technology and ambitious dreams of the future intertwine, creating a unique atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich atmosphere: We used Steam Audio technology so that every sound in the game feels immersive from all directions. Muted noises, echoes in metal corridors, and the vibrations of machines enhance the experience. Every whisper and rustle not only brings the world to life but also keeps you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/7af9ff1d06e5f448bf00d8aa80b4a609.poster.avif?t=1732205958\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/7af9ff1d06e5f448bf00d8aa80b4a609.webm?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/7af9ff1d06e5f448bf00d8aa80b4a609.mp4?t=1732205958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Silent space: The beautiful and harsh face of the universe simultaneously entices and warns: its mysteries are far from friendly. But it is in this challenge that our true purpose lies, is it not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready, brave explorer, to uncover what really happened on this distant outpost of humanity? Or will you become just another link in its chain of mysteries? Europa awaits your answer.</p>",
    "short_description": "Satellite Odyssey: Jupiter \u2014 a sci-fi horror with survival elements. Explore Europa, and unravel its dark secrets. The game combines exploration, puzzles, and combat with a unique dynamic of two heroes \u2014 a man and his loyal dog. Use their abilities to overcome obstacles and survive.",
